// LAB-7.2: your read policy, rules 1 to 3 of S7.L2 over the S7 world. TODO(you)
//
// `statespace check lab7.2` draws fresh worlds when you run it, writes each world's facts as the
// .facts files these .input relations name, and evaluates this program in Soufflé and in the tab's
// engine (Z3 Fixedpoint behind the course adapter). Your `canread` must equal the reference matrix on
// every world, and one allowed cell per world must have a valid derivation.
//
// Keep the declarations: the generator writes exactly these input relations. Comments use //, because
// Soufflé 2.5 rejects %. Whatever no rule derives is denied.

.decl tenant_of_user(u: symbol, a: symbol)
.decl tenant_of_team(t: symbol, a: symbol)
.decl member(u: symbol, t: symbol, r: symbol)   // r is viewer, editor or admin
.decl owns(t: symbol, d: symbol)
.decl subteam(s: symbol, t: symbol)             // s is nested in t
.decl share_user(d: symbol, u: symbol)
.decl share_team(d: symbol, t: symbol)
.decl revoked(d: symbol, u: symbol)
.input tenant_of_user
.input tenant_of_team
.input member
.input owns
.input subteam
.input share_user
.input share_team
.input revoked

.decl inteam(u: symbol, t: symbol)
.decl canread(u: symbol, d: symbol)
.output canread

